sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Owner
    participant R1 as Replica holding vN-1
    participant R2 as Replica behind or empty
    Note over O: vN signed by the key vN-1 committed to,<br/>committing to a new one, signed once and saved with v0 to vN-1
    O->>R1: UPDATE(vN)
    Note over R1: prev is the hash of the stored vN-1, the key hashes<br/>to its nextKeyHash, the signature verifies: replace
    R1-->>O: Updated
    O->>R2: UPDATE(vN)
    R2-->>O: MissingPrevious (the seq it holds, or none)
    Note over O,R2: replay, one version at a time, each answer awaited
    O->>R2: STORE(v0), only if it holds nothing (R2)
    R2-->>O: Stored
    O->>R2: UPDATE(v1) to UPDATE(vN), each checked against the one before
    R2-->>O: Updated
    Note over O: strict majority of the consistency group (alpha),<br/>then write the local copy
